flowchart TD
    %% Diagram 4a: Activity - Patient Appointment Cancellation
    %% Based on src/app/account/page.tsx implementation

    Start([Start]) --> A[Select Appointment to Cancel]
    A --> B[Open Branded Confirmation Dialog]
    B --> C{Confirm Cancel?}

    C -->|Keep Visit| D[Close Dialog]
    D --> E([Return to Appointments])

    C -->|Cancel Visit| F[Call RPC cancel_my_appointment]
    F --> G{Cancellation Success?}

    G -->|Error: not_cancellable| H[Show Error:<br/>Cannot Cancel Online]
    H --> E

    G -->|Other Error| I[Show Error:<br/>Contact Clinic]
    I --> E

    G -->|Success| J[Mark appointment<br/>as cancelled]
    J --> K[Show Success Toast]
    K --> E

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1,stroke:#059669,stroke-width:2px
    style C fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:1px
    style F fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:1px